@startuml
title State Diagram - Student Result Predicting System

[*] --> Admin_Login

Admin_Login --> Add_Student : Admin adds student
Add_Student --> Add_Staff : Admin adds staff
Add_Staff --> Add_Course : Admin adds course
Add_Course --> Add_Subject : Admin adds subject

Add_Subject --> Enrollment_Process : Enroll staff & student
Enrollment_Process --> Teaching_In_Progress : semester starts

Teaching_In_Progress --> Staff_Add_Result : staff enters marks
Staff_Add_Result --> Result_Published : publish results

Result_Published --> Admin_Select_Student : admin selects student
Admin_Select_Student --> Predict_Result : run prediction model
Predict_Result --> Prediction_Shown

Prediction_Shown --> [*]

@enduml
